    "description": "<p>You shatter a druid's Wild Shape, forcing immediate reversion and dealing 6d10 psychic damage from the dissonance of overwritten form. For 24 hours after, the druid must succeed on a Wisdom save (your DC) to enter Wild Shape again. On a critical failure (roll of 1), the druid cannot Wild Shape for 7 days. This is not a curse. It is a correction.</p>",
